5,1,1,talk,Minato,,I wonder if the ground here will be tricky for the diggers. Has anyone checked the earlier works?,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,"Minato, that’s a fair point. But I’m more worried about the long-term upkeep costs. Who’s really paying for the maintenance after the ribbon is cut?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I agree with May. I’d like to see how the previous projects are holding up today, rather than just the pretty drawings.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I’m concerned about staffing. Who actually maintains this weekly? The rota seems shrinking.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,You’re all staring at the paper. I’m staring at the mud. Let’s see if the drainage actually works before we dream.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minato,,I’m a bit lost. Does the mud really matter more than the people? I just want to know if the ground is safe.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
